{"seq":1,"slug":"restockable-return-inventory","title":"可再售品回库与库存恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/resale-destroy-link/restockable-return-inventory","wordCount":2049,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"可再售品回库与库存恢复\">可再售品回库与库存恢复</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一件 A 级退货翻新完成、标签重打完毕，它现在「可以卖」了。但它在系统里能不能卖，是另一个问题。正向入库的商品天然是可售的：采购入库、上架、库存 +1。逆向入库的商品不行——它在物理上到达仓库是一件事，它在性质上可以被承诺给下一个买家是另一件事，而这两件事之间隔着一段必须被显式建模的距离。</p>\n<p>这一段距离就是<strong>逆向库存的特殊性</strong>。本文讲的是把物理事实变成可承诺库存的过程：在途库存的可见性、待判定隔离区的状态模型、再售品的成本基准、以及跨境调拨时的账套同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆向库存与销售库存的语义差异\">逆向库存与销售库存的语义差异</h2><p>正向销售库存的可用性大致是二元的：在库且未被占用即可售。逆向库存不是二元的，因为它同时带着三种不确定性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不确定性</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>消除时点</th>\n<th>对可用性的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能否入库</td>\n<td>在途、清关未放行</td>\n<td>清关放行 + 到仓收货核对</td>\n<td>完全不可承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否可售</td>\n<td>待质检、待翻新</td>\n<td>质检出等级 + 翻新完成</td>\n<td>数量不确定（可能部分不可售）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>以什么成本可售</td>\n<td>成本基准未定</td>\n<td>全部成本归集完成</td>\n<td>影响毛利口径而非可售性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一种不确定性决定了「在途库存不能计入可承诺量」这条铁律。把在途逆向库存计入可用量，是逆向系统最常见的资损来源：一旦清关被拒或货损，已经承诺出去的订单就要违约。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隔离区的状态模型\">隔离区的状态模型</h3><p>物理上到达仓库、但尚未完成质检与翻新的货，必须待在一个与销售库存隔离的状态里。隔离区不是「一个仓库位置」，而是一组互斥的库存状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; IN_TRANSIT: 批次出运(见 1.3)&#10;  IN_TRANSIT --&gt; CUSTOMS_HOLD: 到关待清关&#10;  CUSTOMS_HOLD --&gt; IN_TRANSIT: 放行(见 2.3)&#10;  CUSTOMS_HOLD --&gt; REJECTED: 清关被拒&#10;  IN_TRANSIT --&gt; QUARANTINE: 到仓收货核对通过&#10;  QUARANTINE --&gt; INSPECTING: 进入质检(见 3.1)&#10;  INSPECTING --&gt; REFURBISHING: 判定可翻新&#10;  INSPECTING --&gt; SELLABLE: 达可售标准&#10;  INSPECTING --&gt; UNSALVAGEABLE: 判定不可售&#10;  REFURBISHING --&gt; SELLABLE: 翻新完成&#10;  SELLABLE --&gt; ALLOCATED: 渠道分配(见 3.3)&#10;  ALLOCATED --&gt; [*]: 出库&#10;  UNSALVAGEABLE --&gt; DISPOSAL: 见 4.2&#10;  REJECTED --&gt; DISPOSAL\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; IN_TRANSIT: 批次出运(见 1.3)\n  IN_TRANSIT --&gt; CUSTOMS_HOLD: 到关待清关\n  CUSTOMS_HOLD --&gt; IN_TRANSIT: 放行(见 2.3)\n  CUSTOMS_HOLD --&gt; REJECTED: 清关被拒\n  IN_TRANSIT --&gt; QUARANTINE: 到仓收货核对通过\n  QUARANTINE --&gt; INSPECTING: 进入质检(见 3.1)\n  INSPECTING --&gt; REFURBISHING: 判定可翻新\n  INSPECTING --&gt; SELLABLE: 达可售标准\n  INSPECTING --&gt; UNSALVAGEABLE: 判定不可售\n  REFURBISHING --&gt; SELLABLE: 翻新完成\n  SELLABLE --&gt; ALLOCATED: 渠道分配(见 3.3)\n  ALLOCATED --&gt; [*]: 出库\n  UNSALVAGEABLE --&gt; DISPOSAL: 见 4.2\n  REJECTED --&gt; DISPOSAL</pre><p>这个状态机里最关键的约束是 <strong><code>QUARANTINE</code> 与 <code>SELLABLE</code> 之间不存在直接转移</strong>。任何货都必须经过 <code>INSPECTING</code> 才能变成可售——这条约束应该被做成库存表的检查约束或状态机的守卫条件，而不是流程规范。因为在系统层面允许「收货即上架」，就等于允许未经质检的货被卖出去，而这会同时产生客诉、退货、以及一轮完整的链路成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"收货核对-状态机的入口守卫\">收货核对：状态机的入口守卫</h3><p>进入 <code>QUARANTINE</code> 之前有一次核对，它的依据是 <a href=\"../return-consolidate-overseas/return-batch-consolidate\">1.3</a> 封批时冻结的清单哈希。核对的三个结果必须分开处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核对结果</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全一致</td>\n<td>整批进隔离区</td>\n<td>正常路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量缺失</td>\n<td>差异件转异常队列，其余正常入库</td>\n<td>触发承运商索赔（有时效）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实物与清单不符</td>\n<td>该件转异常队列，不自动入库</td>\n<td>可能是装柜错误或调包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二、三种情况必须在<strong>承运商索赔时效内</strong>处理，这个时效约束意味着异常队列不能是一个「有空再看」的队列——它需要一个与外部索赔窗口绑定的截止时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本基准-逆向库存的会计难题\">成本基准：逆向库存的会计难题</h2><p>商品在库存里必须有一个成本，因为它决定了后续销售的毛利。正向入库的成本基准是清晰的（采购价 + 头程运费）。逆向入库的成本基准要复杂得多，因为沿途的成本有些应该计入，有些应该作为损失立刻确认。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>是否计入再售品成本基准</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买家退货运费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>为把这件货拿回来而付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集货节点操作费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>直接服务于该件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境回运费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>直接服务于该件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已缴关税 / 关税损失</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>该件的到岸成本组成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质检与翻新成本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>让该件达到可售状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原订单的履约成本</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>已在原销售中确认，不重复计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款金额</td>\n<td>否（独立科目）</td>\n<td>退款是收入冲减，不是存货成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条口径的工程含义是：<strong>需要一个能从多个来源归集成本到单件的能力</strong>。成本分散在退货单、集拼批次、清关申报、质检工单、翻新工单五个来源里，而库存成本基准是它们的和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></munder><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{basis} = \\sum_{s \\in sources} cost(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3274em;vertical-align:-1.2774em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ces</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE return_inventory_cost_component (&#10;  rma_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  source        VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,   -- RETURN_SHIP/CONSOLIDATE/FREIGHT/CUSTOMS/INSPECT/REFURB&#10;  amount        NUMERIC(12,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency      CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  fx_rate       NUMERIC(18,8) NOT NULL, -- 计入时的折算率&#10;  booked_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (rma_id, source, booked_at)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE VIEW v_return_item_cost_basis AS&#10;SELECT rma_id,&#10;       sum(amount * fx_rate) AS cost_basis_reporting_ccy,&#10;       count(*)              AS component_count&#10;FROM return_inventory_cost_component&#10;GROUP BY rma_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> return_inventory_cost_component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rma_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- RETURN_SHIP/CONSOLIDATE/FREIGHT/CUSTOMS/INSPECT/REFURB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fx_rate       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计入时的折算率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  booked_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (rma_id, source, booked_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_return_item_cost_basis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rma_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fx_rate) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_basis_reporting_ccy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> component_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> return_inventory_cost_component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rma_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把成本做成<strong>明细表 + 视图</strong>而不是库存行上的一个数字字段，有一个实际原因：<strong>成本会迟到</strong>。清关的关税可能在货入库之后才最终确定（<a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/export-return-reimport-tax\">2.1</a> 的先征后退制下更是如此，退还部分要等很久）。如果成本基准是库存行上的一个字段，补记一笔就会改动历史销售单据背后的成本，账务上不可接受；做成明细表，则可以让库存持有「已归集成本 + 待归集估计」两个口径，并在明细补齐后通过调整单修正。</p>\n<h3 id=\"待归集估计与最终结算\">待归集估计与最终结算</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rma_id&quot;: 88213374,&#10;  &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;SKU-ROBOT-VAC-S8&quot;,&#10;  &quot;inventory_state&quot;: &quot;SELLABLE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grade_as_shipped&quot;: &quot;B&quot;,&#10;  &quot;cost_basis&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;booked_components&quot;: 41.28,&#10;    &quot;pending_estimate&quot;: 6.1,&#10;    &quot;pending_reason&quot;: &quot;CUSTOMS_DUTY_NOT_FINAL&quot;,&#10;    &quot;settled&quot;: false&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;valuation_policy&quot;: &quot;LOWER_OF_COST_AND_NRV&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rma_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88213374</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-ROBOT-VAC-S8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inventory_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELLABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grade_as_shipped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cost_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"booked_components\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41.28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"pending_estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"pending_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CUSTOMS_DUTY_NOT_FINAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"settled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"valuation_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LOWER_OF_COST_AND_NRV\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>valuation_policy</code> 指向的是存货计价的通用原则：存货应以<strong>成本与可变现净值（net realisable value, NRV）中的较低者</strong>计量，可变现净值是「在正常经营过程中的估计售价，减去估计完工成本与估计销售所需成本」，而任何将存货减记至 NRV 的损失必须在其发生的期间确认为费用（见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-2-inventories/\">IAS 2 Inventories, IFRS Foundation</a>）。在逆向库存里这条原则触发得极其频繁——一件缺口包装的 B 级货，它的累计成本很可能已经超过它在开箱渠道的可实现价（<a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel\">3.3</a> 的保留价计算会用同一组数）。<strong>识别并显式确认这种减值，比把成本藏在库存里更重要</strong>，因为它决定了这条退货链路是否值得继续投入——如果某个品类的减值率高居不下，正确的动作是回到 <a href=\"../return-consolidate-overseas/dispose-local-vs-return\">1.2</a> 调高该品类的回运门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境调拨与账套同步\">跨境调拨与账套同步</h2><p>当翻新中心与销售市场不在同一关境时（例如在中国翻新的货要重新发往美国站销售），库存必须在两个账套之间同步，这引入一个正向履约里没有的问题：<strong>同一件货在两个关境下的存货价值可能不同</strong>，因为它背负着不同的关税与流转税。这属于多账簿与转移定价的范畴，本 hub 只在两点上触及：一是调拨单必须携带<strong>成本基准的继承规则</strong>（哪些成本随货走、哪些留在原账套），二是调拨的在途状态与上面讲的第一种不确定性是同一类问题——在途即不可承诺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻篇的衔接\">与相邻篇的衔接</h2><p>本篇是逆向库存的收口点：它接收 <a href=\"../return-reimport-customs/return-customs-doc-status\">2.3</a> 的放行信号、<a href=\"../return-consolidate-overseas/return-batch-consolidate\">1.3</a> 的封批清单做核对、<a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/central-inspection-grade\">3.1</a> 与 <a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/refurbish-repack-relabel\">3.2</a> 的等级与成本、<a href=\"../inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel\">3.3</a> 的渠道分配；不可售的分支流向 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/defect-destroy-secondary\">4.2 残次销毁/二手转售处置</a>。本篇的成本基准与减值是 <a href=\"../resale-destroy-link/refund-inspection-link\">4.3 质检结论与退款联动</a> 资损分析的账面依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>逆向库存的可用性是三重的（能否入库、是否可售、以什么成本可售），在途与隔离区的货都不可承诺。</li>\n<li>必须在状态机层面禁止「收货即上架」；<code>QUARANTINE</code> 到 <code>SELLABLE</code> 之间不存在直接转移。</li>\n<li>收货核对以封批清单哈希为依据，差异必须进入有索赔时效约束的异常队列。</li>\n<li>成本基准应做成明细表加视图，而不是库存行上的单一数字，因为成本会迟到（清关结论、退税周期）。</li>\n<li>已归集成本与待归集估计必须分口径；可变现净值低于成本时应显式确认减值，减值率是回运门槛的校准信号。</li>\n<li>跨境调拨下同一件货在不同关境的存货价值可能不同，调拨单必须携带成本基准的继承规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可再售品回库与库存恢复","id":"可再售品回库与库存恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向库存与销售库存的语义差异","id":"逆向库存与销售库存的语义差异"},{"level":3,"text":"隔离区的状态模型","id":"隔离区的状态模型"},{"level":3,"text":"收货核对：状态机的入口守卫","id":"收货核对-状态机的入口守卫"},{"level":2,"text":"成本基准：逆向库存的会计难题","id":"成本基准-逆向库存的会计难题"},{"level":3,"text":"待归集估计与最终结算","id":"待归集估计与最终结算"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境调拨与账套同步","id":"跨境调拨与账套同步"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻篇的衔接","id":"与相邻篇的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分级降级与渠道分流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/inspect-grade-refurbish/grade-downgrade-channel"},"next":{"title":"残次销毁/二手转售处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-returns-inspection-refurb-center/resale-destroy-link/defect-destroy-secondary"}}